    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "###Dream it. Describe it. Build it.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/99d7f396c47a604d6ca01825a08c4ab2-Panel 1.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-kickoff-f53be11d-a281-4bb0-a62e-c63389ee7dc6",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Start with a vision. \nWho needs something, and what would you make for them? You’ll pick up the language of web developers as you build with AI.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ab398ff421cc49dda5ad4547c45ea4ce-Panel 2.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-kickoff-3e0098fb-b792-442e-ade6-acaf5400fbde",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Spark your ideas.\nCheck out these examples then think about what YOU want to build!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c8d6eae80b0e56a0ff6f77049964a597-Panel 3.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-kickoff-a1596eb7-255e-4629-8dc8-a4a4dc65fd23",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Second Helpings\nConnect extra food with the people who need it, before it goes to waste.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b9499ec8e0d0089c1a804c9782dacd63-Second Helpings meal pickup dashboard.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-kickoff-388e91e4-3f9c-4072-a12c-81dead86efd2",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "####Open Door\nMake it easier for a teen to find the right support at the right moment.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/fdce7115752a614e912d3f6bbfea64cd-Calm Open Door teen support dashboard.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-kickoff-8da3742a-efad-47fd-b3bd-6c3b62e712f4",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Puente\nMake sure every family can understand what’s happening at school.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4d73db76c6b43c86d4f2e73a172a849d-Puente_ School news in your language.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-kickoff-3fc8f926-869c-4d76-86d0-b4041931f9f5",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "####Build it!\nIn this lesson, your path is unique. Share your idea and your coding experience, and your lesson shifts with every answer along the way.",
